CharacterName,Morphling,變體精靈
ClassDescription,"A fluid DOTA2 hero who commands surging waves, shifts freely between Strength and Agility, empowers himself through Ebb & Flow, and morphs into foes.",來自 DOTA2 的水元素英雄：能化作波浪突進、自由轉換力量與敏捷、憑先天技能「潮漲潮落」隨屬性動態強化移速/射程/施法距離/減速抗性，並可變形為敵人形態。
ClassName,morphling//female,變體精靈
ClassName,morphling//male,變體精靈
ClassName,morphling//non-binary,變體精靈
EntityDescription,"A sentient elemental forged from living tidewater, capable of reshaping its physical attributes at will.",由活水潮汐凝聚而成的智慧元素，能隨心重塑自身的力量與敏捷形態。
EntityName,waterkin,變體水靈
ItemDescription,A condensed sphere of living tidewater launched as infinite ranged ammunition from a sling.,由活水潮汐凝聚的遠程水彈，可作為彈弓無限彈藥發射。
ItemName,tidal orb,潮汐水彈
PropertyDescription,Innate (Ebb & Flow): Agility grants bonus movement speed and ranged attack range; Strength grants bonus spell cast range and slow resistance. Persists while morphed.,先天技能「潮漲潮落」：敏捷提供額外移速與遠程攻擊距離；力量提供額外施法距離與減速抗性（變形期間持續保留）。
PropertyName,ebb and flow,潮漲潮落
RaceName,waterkin//female,變體水靈
RaceName,waterkin//male,變體水靈
RaceName,waterkin//non-binary,變體水靈
SpellDescription,"Assume the form of a targeted creature, copying its body, attributes, skills, and spells while retaining Ebb & Flow.",指向一名生物並化身為對方形態，複製其外形、屬性、技能與法術，且先天技能「潮漲潮落」持續保留。
SpellDescription,"Dissolve into a surging wave, blinking forward, splashing water damage around you, and briefly gaining phasing and displacement.",化作洶湧波浪向前閃爍突進，對周圍敵人造成水波範圍傷害，並短暫獲得穿牆與幻影閃避。
SpellDescription,"Launch a surge of water dealing base damage, knocking back, and stunning the target. Bonus damage scales with Agility-to-Strength ratio while stun duration scales with Strength-to-Agility ratio.",發射高壓水波造成基礎水傷並擊退眩暈目標：額外爆發傷害隨敏捷/力量比值動態提升，眩暈時長隨力量/敏捷比值動態延長。
SpellDescription,Release your morphed form and immediately return to your true waterkin body.,解除當前變形狀態，立即切回變體水靈本體。
SpellDescription,"Shift Agility into Strength and Constitution (1 to 5 points by mastery), conserving total stats while raising both maximum and current HP.",將敏捷轉化為力量與體質（隨變化系熟練度每次 1~5 點），總量守恆並同步提升最大生命與當前生命。
SpellDescription,"Shift Strength and Constitution into Agility (1 to 5 points by mastery), conserving total stats and lowering maximum HP without draining current HP.",將力量與體質轉化為敏捷（隨變化系熟練度每次 1~5 點），總量守恆並降低最大生命值，當前生命值僅在超過新上限時截斷。
SpellName,adaptive strike,變體打擊
SpellName,morph,變形
SpellName,morph agility,屬性轉換·敏捷
SpellName,morph revert,解除變形
SpellName,morph strength,屬性轉換·力量
SpellName,waveform,波浪形態
